/**
 * /hard-texts/ — 100% native Astro (AGENTS-r250 → visual-fix-hard-texts-2026-06-23).
 *
 * No legacy full-document shadow loader, no raw HTML fragments, no legacy
 * transport files. The <head> is hand-authored native Astro markup; cache-bust
 * version hashes
 * for every CSS asset are computed at build time via md5short so they stay in
 * lockstep with `scripts/cache-bust.js`. Body chrome (<main> excluded) lives in
 * HardTextsPageChrome / HardTextsPageFooter; the semantic <main> is composed
 * from named leaf components inside HardTextsMain.
 *
 * Pixel parity proof:
 *   npm run hard-texts:visual-parity:audit
 *   npm run visual:parity:screenshots -- --routes /hard-texts/
 */
